I'm not sure what you're talking about. .requiredVersion() is just a call to withSetRewriter which sets the setRewriter for the valued attribute. withSetRewriter looks like this
```
public ValuedAttribute withSetRewriter(BiFunction<Double, Double, Double> rewriteFunction) {
        this.setRewriter = rewriteFunction;
        return this;
    }
```
It literally overwrites the setRewriter, as in there is only one setRewriter on the ValuedAttribute. If I want to change the behaviour of course I have to overwrite it and include the old and new functionality. There is no option to call super.setRewriter.apply() or something of the sort as far as I can tell.

